module load intel
cd astra_rep

--------------------------------------

cd ASTRA

We build:

lib/libfor.a (make -f Makefor)
lib/libnbi.a (make -f Makenbi)
lib/model   (make -f Makemodel)
lib/jexfile.o is still precompiled

The fml directory is required to compile "for" (metric.f stepup_new.f) and "nbi" (nbinj.f)
The tmp directory is required to compile "for"

-------------------------------------

cd EQUIL

We build:

SPIDER
COUPLING_SCHEME

into lib/libspider.a (make -f Makeequil)

--------------------------------------

Both ASTRA and EQUIL libraries are used for ASTRA user-compilation
